%% 主流程一：汇总下单保存损耗率（/purchase 保存修改）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 采购操作员
    participant M as SummaryModal.vue
    participant S as useSummaryModal.ts
    participant A as usePurchaseActions.ts
    participant API as purchaseApi
    participant R as order_routes.py
    participant C as purchase_order_crud
    participant U2 as SpareUtil
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as L1+L2 缓存

    U->>M: 输入损耗率(千分之几, 0..1000)
    M->>S: applyLossRate(rate) debounce 300ms -> lossRateTouched=true
    U->>M: 点击「保存修改」(编辑态)
    M->>A: saveEdits
    A->>S: saveFactoryEdits()
    S->>API: saveFactoryEdits(edits, spare_rate=lossRate)
    API->>R: POST /orders/factory-summary/save {edits, spare_rate}
    R->>C: save_factory_summary_edits(db, edits, spare_rate)
    loop 每个编辑分组
        C->>DB: 更新 PurchaseOrderItem.quantity
        C->>DB: 定位所属 PurchaseOrder
        C->>U2: normalize_spare_rate(rate)
        C->>U2: calc_spare_quantity(product_quantity, rate)
        C->>DB: 覆盖写 PurchaseOrder.spare_rate / spare_quantity
    end
    C-->>R: {updated_count}
    R->>DB: commit (db_transaction)
    R->>Cache: invalidate_cache('orders:p*') + invalidate_cache('orders:beile:*')
    R-->>API: success
    API-->>S: {success}
    S-->>A: 保存成功

%% 主流程二：下单完成并同步到 /beile-order
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 采购操作员
    participant P as ActiveOrdersPanel.vue
    participant A as usePurchaseActions.ts
    participant PO as usePurchaseOrders.ts
    participant API as purchaseApi
    participant R as order_routes.py
    participant C as purchase_order_crud
    participant U2 as SpareUtil
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as L1+L2 缓存
    participant BE as services/order/beile.py
    participant BV as /beile-order 前端

    Note over P: 行内「下单完成」按钮 (ActiveOrdersPanel :95-100)
    U->>P: 点击「下单完成」
    P->>A: completeOrder(orderId)
    A->>PO: completeOrder(orderId, spare_rate=当前损耗率若已交互)
    PO->>API: completePurchaseOrder(id, spare_rate)
    API->>R: POST /orders/complete {order_id, spare_rate?}
    R->>C: complete_purchase_order(db, id, user, spare_rate)
    C->>DB: status='completed', completed_at=now
    alt spare_rate 提供
        C->>U2: normalize + calc
        C->>DB: 覆盖写 spare_rate / spare_quantity
    else spare_rate 为 None
        C->>DB: 保留该采购单已存 spare_rate/spare_quantity
    end
    C-->>R: {id, order_no, status}
    R->>DB: commit
    R->>Cache: invalidate_cache('orders:p*') + invalidate_cache('orders:beile:*')
    R-->>API: success

    Note over BV: 用户切到 /beile-order（无需手动刷新）
    BV->>BE: GET /orders/beile-list
    BE->>Cache: 查 orders:beile:list:...
    BE->>DB: SELECT completed 采购单（一次）
    BE->>BE: 内存建 by_order_id / by_customer_product 映射
    BE->>DB: 拉当前页 Order / StockIn
    BE->>BE: MAX 口径 -> purchase_order_qty/spare_quantity/spare_rate/is_ordered
    BE-->>BV: {data:[...], unconfirmed_count}
    BV->>BV: 数量列=实际下单量 + 备品列 + 未下单徽章/门控

%% 门控：未下单确认被拒（后端）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BV as /beile-order
    participant E as order.py confirm 端点
    participant BE as beile.py confirm_beile_order
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    BV->>E: POST /orders/{id}/confirm
    E->>BE: confirm_beile_order(db, id, user)
    BE->>DB: 查订单(湖北+未删除, FOR UPDATE)
    BE->>DB: 查是否存在 completed 关联采购单
    alt 不存在 completed 关联单
        BE-->>E: raise ConflictError
        E-->>BV: 409 detail=该订单未在采购中心完成下单，请先在采购中心完成下单后再确认
        BV->>BV: toast.error(detail)
    else 存在
        BE->>DB: 写 confirmed_at / confirmed_by_id；标记通知已读
        BE-->>E: {success:true}
        E-->>BV: 200
    end
